<DOCTYPE html>
  <html>
    <body>
      <div class="background-container">
    <div class="content-container">
      <h1>Hollow Knight is peak!</h1>
       <img src="https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/7da531de-8f06-4c0c-928f-bcb5ebf142cd/ddekmze-bd4a5be3-1098-4ece-a5ca-a0b3a035f4f3.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..cYiZtIFZG-kMJ-iVV2-g3DGMwlR6Ht_3zBg6rW3PHCc" alt="Description of image" class="floated-img">
      <p>In <a href="https://www.hollowknight.com/">Hollow Knight </a>, you will have fun exploring <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Hallownest"> Hallownest</a>, trecking through the empty <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Forgotten_Crossroads">Forgotten Crossroads </a>, the lush greenery of <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Greenpath">Greenpath </a>, and even the beautiful <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/White_Palace"> White Palace. </a>
      Though, you will have to fight enemies, ramping up in difficulty as you progress. 
      Bosses can range from the easy <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/False_Knight">False Knight </a>, all the way to the painful <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Absolute_Radiance">Absolute Radiance. </a>
      There is even difficult platforming, like the infamous <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a5EUUB5_HwY"> Path of Pain. </a>
      As soon as you unlock <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Mothwing_Cloak"> Dash </a> and <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Mantis_Claw"> Mantis Claw, </a> you will be able to achieve an unlimited amount of platforming. There will even be ways to upgrade the three spells, <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Vengeful_Spirit">Vengeful Spirit </a> becomes the <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Shade_Soul"> Shade Soul </a>, the <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Desolate_Dive"> Desolate Dive </a> becomes <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Descending_Dark"> Descending Dark </a>, and <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Howling_Wraiths"> Howling Wraiths </a> becomes <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"alt="Description of image" class="floated-img2"> <a href="https://hollowknight.fandom.com/wiki/Abyss_Shriek"> Abyss Shriek.</a> </p>
     
    </div>
</div>
    </body>
  </html>
